<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.1.9">
<l>nampa ṉēnaviṉ ṟēttaval lārkaḷ</l>
<l rend="indent">nāta ṉēnara ciṅkama tāṉāy</l>
<l>umpar kōṉula kēḻuma ḷantāy</l>
<l rend="indent">ūḻi yāyiṉā yāḻimuṉ ṉēnti</l>
<l>kampa mākari kōḷviṭut tāṉē</l>
<l rend="indent">kāra ṇākaṭa laikkaṭain tāṉē</l>
<l>empi rāṉeṉṉai yāḷuṭait tēṉē</l>
<l rend="indent">ēḻai yēṉiṭa raikkaḷai yāyē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Lord of those who, having practised, have mastered [your] praise!</l>
<l rend="indent">Lord who became the man-lion!</l>
<l>King of celestials! You who measured the seven worlds!</l>
<l rend="indent">You are the aeons,</l>
<l>bearing the discus long ago, you who ended the suffering</l>
<l rend="indent">of the great, trembling elephant!</l>
<l>[First] Cause! Churner of the sea!</l>
<l rend="indent">Our Lord, the Nectar who has me as servant!</l>
<l>Remove the distress of this wretch!</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
